    "displayName": "pl_bronze_pg_partition_append",
    "description": "One-time PostgreSQL baseline continuation: appends a bounded non-overlapping key range to a target initialized by the overwrite child. The lower-exclusive/upper-inclusive interval prevents boundary duplicates. Not for recurring incremental loads."
